@host = http://localhost:5000

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Create the first company + owner
POST {{host}}/api/auth/bootstrap
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyName": "Demo Company",
  "username": "owner",
  "displayName": "Demo Owner",
  "password": "ChangeMe-12345"
}

### Login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "owner",
  "password": "ChangeMe-12345",
  "deviceName": "Development PC",
  "platform": "Windows"
}

### Current user
# Replace TOKEN with accessToken returned by /login
GET {{host}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
